{"synopsis":"Ian Percus, seorang mahasiswa tahun ketiga dari departemen ilmu pedang Akademi, terbangun suatu pagi dan menemukan kalender flip di mejanya serta sebuah surat yang tidak ia ingat pernah menerimanya. Surat itu berisi pesan misterius: “Jika kita tidak melindungi masa depan, dunia akan binasa.”\n\nKetika ia pergi ke Akademi, ia menyadari bahwa, tanpa sepengetahuannya, seminggu telah berlalu dan selama waktu itu, ia dikabarkan telah mengalahkan seorang junior yang sebelumnya tak terkalahkan.\n\nAwalnya, Ian skeptis, tetapi saat peristiwa-peristiwa yang dijelaskan dalam surat itu mulai terjadi, ia perlahan mulai percaya pada apa yang tertulis.\n\nApa yang sebenarnya terjadi selama seminggu yang tidak ia ingat…?\n\nAkankah Ian mampu melindungi masa depan?","alternative_title":"미래에서 온 연애편지","author":"Alcoholic, Yeohan","artist":"HOTAE","chapters":[{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"6c6f59cf-7734-4545-bb30-1c2adc019a52","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"fb270939-9aec-4121-a421-3a2527cdad68","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"07c2ad07-24b3-4b1c-8568-36b4f7dc5b66","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"f74bef7a-21e2-450a-bf35-60cb48a44184","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"06038649-1fe8-4eee-83af-d53ce6cea231","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"66cdd087-0c5f-4338-9abf-87927b358c40","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-30"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"b01c045a-d1ce-47a9-a96f-97cdf781a73d","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-05-28"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"e42428bb-0cb2-41fc-89f0-5c322b3337cd","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-05-28"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"00f21fc1-e399-4d19-8681-56f6aee4bf71","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-05-28"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"3874ab16-9b4a-4c3e-b0f4-81402b10f1